<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-095-B habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.431456" lon="-120.948423"><name>SC26-095-B</name><cmt>SC26-095</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 7.4 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 66/100; not catch probability. Center 55 ft; nearby 53–74 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-075</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.43458034166245" lon="-120.94927965800026"/><trkpt lat="35.43432497379186" lon="-120.95016732806796"/><trkpt lat="35.43353454503651" lon="-120.95139899680929"/><trkpt lat="35.432823005873566" lon="-120.95196776125096"/><trkpt lat="35.43192563990737" lon="-120.95221078361045"/><trkpt lat="35.431739815366285" lon="-120.951885053244"/><trkpt lat="35.431730473183094" lon="-120.95133456208367"/><trkpt lat="35.43136816378096" lon="-120.95123359707276"/><trkpt lat="35.431263100347536" lon="-120.95035509999632"/><trkpt lat="35.43081254972365" lon="-120.95036652110565"/><trkpt lat="35.430621110563536" lon="-120.9497105097871"/><trkpt lat="35.43043902021665" lon="-120.94960498325435"/><trkpt lat="35.430431538592295" lon="-120.94916459801675"/><trkpt lat="35.43006548611829" lon="-120.94884345259692"/><trkpt lat="35.4299660204